Subject: [PATCH 3/3] Use the configured base URLs for TVDB and TVMaze

Build TVDB and TVMaze request URLs, including the calendar's TVMaze
lookups and the TVDB key check in Settings, from settings.TVDB_BASE_URL
and settings.TVMAZE_BASE_URL. When either points at a mirror, the public
host's rate limiter is mounted on the mirror too, so requests to it are
paced the same way.
